// against tests/engine_fixtures.inc, generated by
// tools/gen/gen_engine_fixtures.py from the Swiss Ephemeris swetest CLI
// running on the same DE440 file (output-only oracle), so the residuals
// measure the apparent-place and frame models alone. Also: the DE binary
// and de440s.bsp give identical answers through the engine.
